Ubuntu .../20.04/22.04

Install:
sudo apt install libxaw7
sudo apt install libxaw7-dev

Simple:
gcc -Wall -pedantic -DSCORE_FILE=\"./xpipescores\" -o xpipeman main.c game.c actions.c graphics.c score.c info.c popup.c -lXaw -lXmu -lXt -lSM -lICE -lXext -lX11 -lm

Or using the Makefile.tra:
make -f Makefile.tra clean && make -f Makefile.tra

Or with xmkmf/imake:
xmkmf -a && make clean && make CFLAGS="-DSCORE_FILE='\"./xpipescores\"'"
